   "tag": "h3",
   "y": 4374,
   "x": 733,
   "w": 301,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Medians lead the time readout"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "y": 4374,
   "x": 1059,
   "w": 301,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Intervals, not causal proof"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4404,
   "x": 80,
   "w": 301,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "18,000 rows and user IDs. Group labels are trimmed before comparison, consolidating 19 labels with trailing whitespace. Mixed date formats are parsed into 42 daily periods."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4404,
   "x": 406,
   "w": 301,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Response and duration summaries skip missing values. All 903 missing responses align with pre-doctor loss; all 2,164 missing durations align with incomplete consultations. Follow-up excludes 186 missing values."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4404,
   "x": 733,
   "w": 301,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Seven response times exceed one hour and seven consultation durations equal 640 minutes. Medians and p90s are emphasized so these extremes do not define the headline."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4404,
   "x": 1059,
   "w": 301,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Rate intervals use a two-proportion normal approximation with a 1.96 critical value, unadjusted for multiple comparisons. Assignment and randomization details are not supplied."
  },
  {
   "tag": "strong",
   "y": 4521,
   "x": 99,
   "w": 124,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Interpretation guardrail"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 4521,
   "x": 237,
   "w": 1047,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "“Control” and “Treatment” are English labels for the two cleaned source groups. Complaint and department names are translated for readability. No missing outcome is imputed, and no outlier is deleted."
  },
